Passthrough mixer for PX4IO
============================

This file defines passthrough mixers suitable for testing.

Channel group 3, channels 0-7 are passed directly through to the outputs.

M: 1
S: 3 0      0  20000 -10000 -10000  10000

M: 1
S: 3 1      0  20000 -10000 -10000  10000

M: 1
S: 3 2      0  20000 -10000 -10000  10000

M: 1
S: 3 3      0  20000 -10000 -10000  10000

M: 1
S: 3 4      0  20000 -10000 -10000  10000

M: 1
S: 3 5      0  20000 -10000 -10000  10000

M: 1
S: 3 6      0  20000 -10000 -10000  10000

M: 1
S: 3 7      0  20000 -10000 -10000  10000
